+{"schemaVersion":"1","kind":"observation","id":"obs_01M2H1BMCQ18AF390G2D1VH8ZV","recordedAt":"2026-09-14T21:59:48Z","companyId":"example-co","controlIds":["dpdp-rules-2025:8(3)","dpdp-rules-2025:6(1)(a)","sebi-cscrf-2024:ID.AM.S5"],"title":"evidence-request: 3 in onfinance-db-model-master","description":"Three evidence-request gaps in db-models-mongodb.default: (1) target db-models-mongodb.default.user: collection user holds personal data (user_email, user_phone_number, user_full_name, user_fcm_id, profile_pic_url), SPDI (user_password BinaryField, user_binance_auth_creds, user_debank_url) and client financial data (user_portfolio_holdings purchase_price/purchase_qty/portfolio_exposure, user_equity_portfolio_value, user_crypto_portfolio_value) with no retention setting, TTL index or expiry field anywhere in the repo. Requested: the company's record-retention schedule and the record-keeping obligation it relies on for this data. dpdp-rules-2025 8(3) requires personal data, associated traffic data and processing logs to be kept at least 365 days from the date of processing and then erased unless retention is required by law; no in-scope requirement states a fixed record-keeping period for client portfolio data, so the schedule itself is the requested evidence. (2) target db-models-mongodb.default.secrets: collection secrets stores broker trading-account credentials as plain StringField (zerodha_username, zerodha_password, zerodha_2fa, apiSecrets, accessToken) plus accountName, with no hashing, field-level encryption or TTL in the model - the same pattern as user.user_binance_auth_creds. Requested: evidence of encryption at rest or field-level encryption for these SPDI fields under dpdp-rules-2025 6(1)(a), the access-control regime on the collection, and a retention/erasure schedule under dpdp-rules-2025 8(3). (3) target db-models-mongodb.default.new_discussions: several collections carry personal-data identifiers with no retention setting in code - new_discussions (author_id, author_name, author_profile_pic, sub_comments.author_id/author_name, sub_comments.banned_by), entity.social_discussions (scraped social-media author identifiers discussion_author_img/name/username and discussion_url), entity.stock_tips.expert_name, communities.community_admin_name, feedback.feedback_uid, reward.winning_user and user.users_banned. Requested: the retention/erasure schedule for these identifiers under dpdp-rules-2025 8(3), and whether the company relies on the DPDP publicly-available-data exemption for the scraped social-media author data. These are requests for evidence, not confirmed gaps. Regulatory basis: dpdp-rules-2025 8(3), 6(1)(a); sebi-cscrf-2024 ID.AM.S5.","methods":["refresh-metastore"],"subjects":[{"type":"repo","appId":"db-models","repoId":"onfinance-db-model-master"}],"collectedAt":"2026-09-14T21:59:48Z","result":"inconclusive","evidence":[{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/onfinance_db_model_master/models.py:387-428"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/onfinance_db_model_master/models.py:8-15"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/onfinance_db_model_master/models.py:84-95"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/onfinance_db_model_master/models.py:69-75"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/onfinance_db_model_master/models.py:33-45"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/onfinance_db_model_master/models.py:49"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/onfinance_db_model_master/models.py:29"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/onfinance_db_model_master/models.py:480-483"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfi