+{"schemaVersion":"1","kind":"observation","id":"obs_01M2H1VF3NKNYJHS8Z8BXZT3DE","recordedAt":"2026-09-14T21:59:48Z","companyId":"example-co","controlIds":["sebi-cscrf-2024:ID.AM.S5"],"title":"evidence-request: mcp-gateway-mongodb in mongodb-mcp-server","description":"Target mcp-gateway-mongodb: The MongoDB cluster served by this gateway holds the application's pii and financial data (prod dataClassification, applications/mcp-gateway/env/prod.json:21-24) but no repo in the workspace evidences its databases or collections: the server connects to whatever cluster MDB_MCP_CONNECTION_STRING names (src/common/connectionManager.ts:333) and every MongoDB tool takes database and collection as runtime arguments (src/tools/mongodb/create/createCollection.ts:27). The catalog exists only in the live system, so schemas is recorded empty; runtime-probe-datapipeline should collect collection schemas from the prod cluster (mongodb-schema is already a runtime dependency, package.json:187) into the next snapshot, and confirm whether mcp-gateway-mongodb and the separate app-scoped catalog db-models-mongodb (appId db-models) are the same physical cluster. Regulatory basis: sebi-cscrf-2024 ID.AM.S5 (inventories of data and metadata for designated data types).","methods":["refresh-metastore"],"subjects":[{"type":"repo","appId":"mcp-gateway","repoId":"mongodb-mcp-server"}],"collectedAt":"2026-09-14T21:59:48Z","result":"inconclusive","evidence":[{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/mcp-gateway/repos/mongodb-mcp-server/src/common/connectionManager.ts:333"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/mcp-gateway/repos/mongodb-mcp-server/src/tools/mongodb/create/createCollection.ts:27"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/mcp-gateway/repos/mongodb-mcp-server/deploy/aws/README.md:53"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/mcp-gateway/repos/mongodb-mcp-server/package.json:187"}],"provenance":{"harness":"opencode","generatedAt":"2026-09-14T21:59:48Z","sessionId":"ses_f5d